}

/// Staff-editable knobs too small to deserve a table each — the battery-health
/// band thresholds are the first (owner decision 2026-08-24).
///
/// `value` is TEXT, not Json: the no-JSON-columns rule has a closed allowlist
/// and this is not on it. Callers parse. Keep keys dotted and namespaced
/// (`battery.goodMin`) so a future group is greppable.
///
/// Bands are stored as two thresholds rather than three ranges, deliberately:
/// three hand-entered ranges can overlap or leave a gap, two cannot. Good is
/// >= goodMin, fair is >= fairMin, anything below fairMin is bad.
model AppSetting {
